Error [jet.PrivateItem]: `balance` is private to its module
  --> tests/ui/inline_module_private_field_write.jet:15:13
    |
 15 |     account.balance = 5
    |             ^^^^^^^
 Why: A `priv module` is usable only by its enclosing module (`priv(package)`: by its package), and a `priv` field only by its type's module
 Fix: Use `balance` from inside its module, or remove `priv` from its module or field
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0605
